			<div id="content" class="main-content">
				<h2>Licensed Entities</h2>
				<p>Our growing community of Licensed Users spans the globe. It is a diverse and rich network of the world's most eminent coal consumers, producers and traders. The list below is always updated as new Licensed Users join.</p>

			<section class="orange-box">
				<form action="https://www.globalcoal.com/scota/licensedusers.cfm" method="post">
					<input type="text" name="search_broker_input" placeholder="Search for a licensed entity">
					<input type="hidden" name="token" value="D8D44DD0B4AF43FA41EBB8E867D5E48348C53668">

					<button class="btn-spn-prim_one mSpacer"><span>Search</span></button> <a class="btn-spn-sec_one" href="https://www.globalcoal.com/scota/licensedusers.cfm">Reset</a>
				</form>
				<div class="cb"></div>
			</section>

			
				<br />
				<h3>Licensed Companies</h3>
					<p class="small">The entities below have been granted a licence to use SCoTA. If you also have a licence to use SCoTA you may trade with any of them on SCoTA terms (although, if you wish to trade on-screen using SCoTA, you may do so only on the globalCOAL trading platform).</p> 
					<br />
				
				<div class="accordion">
					
						<h3>A</h3>
						<div>
							<ol class="numbered" start="1">
								
						 				<li>321advisors.com Inc</li>
						 			
						 				<li>A &amp; A Services Private Limited</li>
						 			
						 				<li>A &amp; K Associated Services, LLC</li>
						 			
						 				<li>A W Pitman &amp; Co</li>
						 			
						 				<li>A-Powermove trade group</li>
						 			
						 				<li>A.C. Toepfer International GmbH</li>
						 			
						 				<li>a.ozdabak international trade</li>
						 			
						 				<li>A.W. Sutherland Consulting Ltd</li>
						 			
